&lt;h2&gt;Snippets, SFTP alignment, and guide improvements&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fix the ⌘P Snippets shortcut, simplify SFTP file rows, and make the Quick Guide easier to scan.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix ⌘P snippets&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The terminal shortcut opens Snippets consistently. Terminal Triggers remain on their own toolbar button.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Polish SFTP browsing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Remove duplicate row actions, align file columns, and clarify access to local and connection-specific path favorites.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Improve the Quick Guide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Separate instructions into readable steps, complete translations, and cover the transfer queue and folder comparison.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Fix saved agent token lookup&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;The CLI now reads an opted-in token from the correct PromeFTP app data folder, with owner-only permissions.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class="notice"&gt;Requires macOS 13 or later on Apple Silicon. Saved agent tokens remain local and are never written into skill files.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/PROMLEE/promeftp/releases/tag/v1.1.4"&gt;Read the full release notes&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</description>
